                "@id": "webuild:concept-95"
            },
            "skos:changeNote": "alternative definitions:\n\"an entity that can perform actions and participate in interactions (including legal, organisational, or business processes)\"\n\"an entity that is able to carry out actions\"",
            "skos:definition": {
                "@language": "en",
                "@value": "an entity that can perform actions or be treated as acting within a process"
            },
            "skos:inScheme": {
                "@id": "https://iri.suomi.fi/terminology/webuild/"
            },
            "skos:narrower": [
                {
                    "@id": "webuild:concept-6006"
                },
                {
                    "@id": "webuild:concept-94"
                },
                {
                    "@id": "webuild:concept-1"
                },
                {
                    "@id": "webuild:concept-6005"
                }
            ],
            "skos:note": [
                {
                    "@language": "en",
                    "@value": "The term agent represents an upper class / broader concept that would encompass both natural persons, sole traders, organizations, registered organizations, legal entities and others that are capable of actions like \"doing business."
                },
                {
                    "@language": "en",
                    "@value": "Umbrella concept for actors that can act/decide/commit in processes.\nIncludes natural persons and organisations (and therefore legal persons).\nIf you later want “software agent,” introduce it explicitly; do not imply it here unless your use cases require it."
                },
                {
                    "@language": "en",
                    "@value": "“Agent” is the broad umbrella concept covering actors that can participate in business/legal processes (e.g., natural persons, organisations, legal persons, legal entities). If you intend “agent” to include software agents, state that explicitly; otherwise keep it socio-legal and process-oriented."
                }
            ],
            "skos:prefLabel": {
                "@id": "urn:uuid:14b229de-4ba0-48eb-9f7e-ff15a33d4ef4"
            }
        },
        {
            "@id": "webuild:organisation",
            "term:orderedSynonym": {
                "@list": [
                    {
                        "@id": "urn:uuid:5c04db60-09b1-46d2-b459-3c37083e0437"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "term:orderedNote": {
                "@list": [
                    {
                        "@language": "en",
                        "@value": "An organisation may be legally constituted or informal and may include a company, partnership, association, foundation, public authority, international organisation, consortium or comparable collective entity. An organisation does not necessarily have legal personality unless it is also classified as a legal person. An organisation becomes an economic operator when it acts in a commercial or professional capacity. Economic operator is therefore a contextual capacity rather than a narrower synonym of organisation: an economic operator may also be a natural person, such as a sole trader or self-employed person."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "term:orderedBroader": {
                "@list": [
                    {
                        "@id": "webuild:concept-41"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "suomi-meta:publicationStatus": {
                "@id": "http://uri.suomi.fi/codelist/interoperabilityplatform/interoperabilityplatform_status/code/DRAFT"
            },
            "suomi-meta:modifier": "5dc030a4-740f-4dde-9548-4e6e797899d8",
            "suomi-meta:creator": "5dc030a4-740f-4dde-9548-4e6e797899d8",
            "skos:prefLabel": {
                "@id": "urn:uuid:54e8001c-da24-45b5-af92-da7f0c723b08"
            },
            "skos:note": {
                "@language": "en",
                "@value": "An organisation may be legally constituted or informal and may include a company, partnership, association, foundation, public authority, international organisation, consortium or comparable collective entity. An organisation does not necessarily have legal personality unless it is also classified as a legal person. An organisation becomes an economic operator when it acts in a commercial or professional capacity. Economic operator is therefore a contextual capacity rather than a narrower synonym of organisation: an economic operator may also be a natural person, such as a sole trader or self-employed person."
            },
            "skos:inScheme": {
                "@id": "https://iri.suomi.fi/terminology/webuild/"
            },
            "skos:definition": {
                "@language": "en",
                "@value": "an agent formed by persons or other agents that has an identifiable structure and pursues a shared purpose as a collective entity"
            },
            "skos:broader": {
                "@id": "webuild:concept-41"
            },
            "skos:altLabel": {
                "@id": "urn:uuid:5c04db60-09b1-46d2-b459-3c37083e0437"
            },
            "dcterms:modified": {
                "@value": "2026-08-11T13:02:13.077Z",
                "@type": "xsd:dateTime"
            },
            "dcterms:created": {
                "@value": "2026-08-11T13:02:13.077Z",
                "@type": "xsd:dateTime"
            },
            "@type": "skos:Concept"
        },
        {
            "@id": "urn:uuid:54e8001c-da24-45b5-af92-da7f0c723b08",
            "suomi-meta:publicationStatus": {
                "@id": "http://uri.suomi.fi/codelist/interoperabilityplatform/interoperabilityplatform_status/code/DRAFT"
            },
            "skos-xl:literalForm": {
                "@language": "en",
                "@value": "organisation"
            },
            "@type": "skos-xl:Label"
        },
        {
            "@id": "urn:uuid:2cf14d21-2ec9-4f37-96d5-2cf6b3eb543b",
            "suomi-meta:publicationStatus": {
                "@id": "http://uri.suomi.fi/codelist/interoperabilityplatform/interoperabilityplatform_status/code/DRAFT"
            },
            "skos-xl:literalForm": {
                "@language": "en",
                "@value": "platform operator"
            },
            "@type": "skos-xl:Label"
        },
        {
            "@id": "webuild:operator",
            "term:orderedSynonym": {
                "@list": [
                    {
                        "@id": "urn:uuid:2cf14d21-2ec9-4f37-96d5-2cf6b3eb543b"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "term:orderedNote": {
                "@list": [
                    {
                        "@language": "en",
                        "@value": "In the EBWV membership context, the operator is the organization responsible for the operation and administration of the platform used by members of a data-sharing initiative or data space. Its responsibilities may include maintaining the technical service, managing onboarding procedures and supporting membership administration. Being the operator does not by itself imply ownership of the platform or data space, governance authority over the initiative, ownership of exchanged data, or authority to act on behalf of its members."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "suomi-meta:publicationStatus": {
                "@id": "http://uri.suomi.fi/codelist/interoperabilityplatform/interoperabilityplatform_status/code/DRAFT"
            },
            "suomi-meta:modifier": "5dc030a4-740f-4dde-9548-4e6e797899d8",
            "suomi-meta:creator": "5dc030a4-740f-4dde-9548-4e6e797899d8",
            "skos:prefLabel": {
                "@id": "urn:uuid:29bd39a2-a148-435e-b56c-86c882dd8559"
            },
            "skos:note": {
                "@language": "en",
                "@value": "In the EBWV membership context, the operator is the organization responsible for the operation and administration of the platform used by members of a data-sharing initiative or data space. Its responsibilities may include maintaining the technical service, managing onboarding procedures and supporting membership administration. Being the operator does not by itself imply ownership of the platform or data space, governance authority over the initiative, ownership of exchanged data, or authority to act on behalf of its members."
            },
            "skos:inScheme": {
                "@id": "https://iri.suomi.fi/terminology/webuild/"
            },
            "skos:definition": {
                "@language": "en",
                "@value": "an economic operator that hosts and operates a platform and is responsible for onboarding members through it"
            },
            "skos:altLabel": {
                "@id": "urn:uuid:2cf14d21-2ec9-4f37-96d5-2cf6b3eb543b"
            },
            "dcterms:modified": {
                "@value": "2026-08-11T12:55:44.889Z",
                "@type": "xsd:dateTime"
            },
            "dcterms:created": {
                "@value": "2026-08-11T12:55:44.889Z",
                "@type": "xsd:dateTime"
            },
            "@type": "skos:Concept"
        },
        {
            "@id": "urn:uuid:29bd39a2-a148-435e-b56c-86c882dd8559",
            "suomi-meta:publicationStatus": {
                "@id": "http://uri.suomi.fi/codelist/interoperabilityplatform/interoperabilityplatform_status/code/DRAFT"
            },
            "skos-xl:literalForm": {
                "@language": "en",
                "@value": "operator"
            },
            "@type": "skos-xl:Label"
        },
        {
            "@id": "urn:uuid:86b6bf12-c551-4eff-9fee-b0ed999f3985",
            "suomi-meta:publicationStatus": {
                "@id": "http://uri.suomi.fi/codelist/interoperabilityplatform/interoperabilityplatform_status/code/DRAFT"
            },
            "skos-xl:literalForm": {
                "@language": "en",
                "@value": "variable place of work"
            },
            "@type": "skos-xl:Label"
        },
        {
            "@id": "urn:uuid:603c0d47-07c4-4807-9bff-b7354630da23",
            "suomi-meta:publicationStatus": {
                "@id": "http://uri.suomi.fi/codelist/interoperabilityplatform/interoperabilityplatform_status/code/DRAFT"
            },
            "skos-xl:literalForm": {
                "@language": "en",
                "@value": "no fixed workplace"
            },
            "@type": "skos-xl:Label"
        },
        {
            "@id": "webuild:nofixedplaceofwork",
            "term:orderedSynonym": {
                "@list": [
                    {
                        "@id": "urn:uuid:603c0d47-07c4-4807-9bff-b7354630da23"
                    },
                    {
                        "@id": "urn:uuid:86b6bf12-c551-4eff-9fee-b0ed999f3985"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "term:orderedNote": {
                "@list": [
                    {
                        "@language": "en",
                        "@value": "The concept applies to the activity, assignment and period covered by the relevant attestation, rather than to the person’s employment or working arrangements in general. It may apply to mobile or itinerant work, work performed along a route, or work carried out at multiple or changing locations. It does not imply that the country of work is unknown or that no information about the anticipated locations can be provided. In EBWV, it is intended to be represented as a Boolean value."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "suomi-meta:publicationStatus": {
                "@id": "http://uri.suomi.fi/codelist/interoperabilityplatform/interoperabilityplatform_status/code/DRAFT"
            },
            "suomi-meta:modifier": "5dc030a4-740f-4dde-9548-4e6e797899d8",
            "suomi-meta:creator": "5dc030a4-740f-4dde-9548-4e6e797899d8",
            "skos:prefLabel": {
                "@id": "urn:uuid:d3c66386-58f6-455d-889b-1e3c6130d299"
            },
            "skos:note": {
                "@language": "en",
                "@value": "The concept applies to the activity, assignment and period covered by the relevant attestation, rather than to the person’s employment or working arrangements in general. It may apply to mobile or itinerant work, work performed along a route, or work carried out at multiple or changing locations. It does not imply that the country of work is unknown or that no information about the anticipated locations can be provided. In EBWV, it is intended to be represented as a Boolean value."
            },
            "skos:inScheme": {
                "@id": "https://iri.suomi.fi/terminology/webuild/"
            },
            "skos:definition": {
                "@language": "en",
                "@value": "an indication that the work or self-employment activity covered by an attestation is not performed at a single identifiable and stable workplace"
            },
            "skos:altLabel": [
                {
                    "@id": "urn:uuid:603c0d47-07c4-4807-9bff-b7354630da23"
                },
                {
                    "@id": "urn:uuid:86b6bf12-c551-4eff-9fee-b0ed999f3985"
                }
            ],
            "dcterms:modified": {
                "@value": "2026-08-11T12:49:37.098Z",
                "@type": "xsd:dateTime"
            },
            "dcterms:created": {
                "@value": "2026-08-11T12:49:37.098Z",
                "@type": "xsd:dateTime"
            },
            "@type": "skos:Concept"
        },
        {
            "@id": "urn:uuid:d3c66386-58f6-455d-889b-1e3c6130d299",
            "suomi-meta:publicationStatus": {
                "@id": "http://uri.suomi.fi/codelist/interoperabilityplatform/interoperabilityplatform_status/code/DRAFT"
            },
            "skos-xl:literalForm": {
                "@language": "en",
                "@value": "no fixed place of work"
            },
            "@type": "skos-xl:Label"
        },
        {
            "@id": "webuild:onboardedby",
            "term:orderedNote": {
                "@list": [
                    {
                        "@language": "en",
                        "@value": "In the current EBWV model, “onboarded by” identifies the platform used to perform or facilitate the member’s onboarding. It does not necessarily identify the organization legally responsible for approving the membership or operating the platform. The onboarding date, responsible organization, onboarding decision, membership status and assigned roles should be represented separately."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "suomi-meta:publicationStatus": {
                "@id": "http://uri.suomi.fi/codelist/interoperabilityplatform/interoperabilityplatform_status/code/DRAFT"
            },
            "suomi-meta:modifier": "5dc030a4-740f-4dde-9548-4e6e797899d8",
            "suomi-meta:creator": "5dc030a4-740f-4dde-9548-4e6e797899d8",
            "skos:prefLabel": {
                "@id": "urn:uuid:3b0f8ab2-02d4-4d10-ac95-b0be2e789186"
            },
            "skos:note": {
                "@language": "en",
                "@value": "In the current EBWV model, “onboarded by” identifies the platform used to perform or facilitate the member’s onboarding. It does not necessarily identify the organization legally responsible for approving the membership or operating the platform. The onboarding date, responsible organization, onboarding decision, membership status and assigned roles should be represented separately."
            },
            "skos:inScheme": {
                "@id": "https://iri.suomi.fi/terminology/webuild/"
            },
            "skos:definition": {
                "@language": "en",
                "@value": "a platform through which the member associated with a membership was admitted to and registered in a data-sharing initiative or data space"
            },
            "dcterms:modified": {
                "@value": "2026-08-11T12:46:36.293Z",
                "@type": "xsd:dateTime"
            },
            "dcterms:created": {
                "@value": "2026-08-11T12:46:36.293Z",
                "@type": "xsd:dateTime"
            },
            "@type": "skos:Concept"
        },
        {
            "@id": "urn:uuid:3b0f8ab2-02d4-4d10-ac95-b0be2e789186",
            "suomi-meta:publicationStatus": {
                "@id": "http://uri.suomi.fi/codelist/interoperabilityplatform/interoperabilityplatform_status/code/DRAFT"
            },
            "skos-xl:literalForm": {
                "@language": "en",
                "@value": "onboarded by"
            },
            "@type": "skos-xl:Label"
        },
        {
            "@id": "urn:uuid:a335330a-06ab-4129-9ea5-cfb1604973f7",
            "suomi-meta:publicationStatus": {
                "@id": "http://uri.suomi.fi/codelist/interoperabilityplatform/interoperabilityplatform_status/code/DRAFT"
            },
            "skos-xl:literalForm": {
                "@language": "en",
                "@value": "membership holder"
            },
            "@type": "skos-xl:Label"
        },
        {
            "@id": "webuild:member",
            "term:orderedSynonym": {
                "@list": [
                    {
                        "@id": "urn:uuid:a335330a-06ab-4129-9ea5-cfb1604973f7"
                    }
                ]
            },
            "term:orderedNote": {
                "@list": [
                    {
                        "@language": "en",
                        "@value": "A member may be a natural person, organization, legal entity, economic operator or another agent capable of holding membership. In the EBWV context, the member is the agent that is the subject of a membership relationship or membership attestation. Membership may specify the community to which the agent belongs, the platform through which the agent was onboarded and the roles assigned to the agent. Being identified as a member does not by itself specify membership status, access rights, responsibilities or authority to act on behalf of another agent."
                    }
                ]
            },
            "suomi-meta:publicationStatus": {
                "@id": "http://uri.suomi.fi/codelist/interoperabilityplatform/interoperabilityplatform_status/code/DRAFT"
            },
            "suomi-meta:modifier": "5dc030a4-740f-4dde-9548-4e6e797899d8",
            "suomi-meta:creator": "5dc030a4-740f-4dde-9548-4e6e797899d8",
            "skos:prefLabel": {
                "@id": "urn:uuid:944b4ee6-093f-4bd6-a5da-5fb6e8909b78"
            },
            "skos:note": {
                "@language": "en",
                "@value": "A member may be a natural person, organization, legal entity, economic operator or another agent capable of holding membership. In the EBWV context, the member is the agent that is the subject of a membership relationship or membership attestation. Membership may specify the community to which the agent belongs, the platform through which the agent was onboarded and the roles assigned to the agent. Being identified as a member does not by itself specify membership status, access rights, responsibilities or authority to act on behalf of another agent."
            },
            "skos:inScheme": {
                "@id": "https://iri.suomi.fi/terminology/webuild/"
            },
            "skos:definition": {
                "@language": "en",
                "@value": "an agent that holds a recognized membership in an organization, data-sharing initiative, data space or other governed community"
            },
            "skos:altLabel": {
                "@id": "urn:uuid:a335330a-06ab-4129-9ea5-cfb1604973f7"
            },
